<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38576" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέκ-τᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extension,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				305b18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν ἐ.</span> to be capable
			of <i>extension,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>LI</u>
				971b1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of Time,
				<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				111.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>explication, evolution,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἐνέργειαν καὶ ἐ. προχωρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>stretching</i> of a rope, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>; of strands of gut, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				58.13
			</span></i>; of hernia, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐπέκτασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κατ᾽ ἐπέκτασιν παραλελυμένοι</span>
			patients suffering from <i>creeping</i> paralysis, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
			</span></i>
			
				Med.
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.8.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lengthening</i> of a word, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1458b2
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				1458a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				6.14
			</span></i>,al.; of a vowel, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				144.19
			</span></i>.</div>
